# ADR 0006: the ADLC's own artefacts live here, and this file decides which of
# them are yours to keep. It ships with the ADLC rather than being copied into
# the repository's own .gitignore, so the rule cannot go missing per repo.
#
# Ignored: proof of a single run against a single tree, and the state of a
# single SDD run. Both are local, both are rewritten constantly.
attest.json
cycle/

# Kept: the measurement series, and the exclusions you declared.
# measurements/*.jsonl
# not-tests
